## Project Structure
```text
entropy-collapse-tta/
├── README.md               # Main project overview & benchmark results
├── THEORY.md               # Full mathematical derivations and proofs
├── LEARNING_NOTES.md       # Student learning companion & intuitive explanations
├── requirements.txt        # Pinned dependencies
├── pyproject.toml          # Package build configuration
├── configs/                # Experiment configuration YAMLs
│   ├── default.yaml        # Default streaming experiment config
│   └── theory_toy.yaml     # Theoretical toy simulation config
├── src/
│   ├── metrics/            # Numerically stable entropy, IM loss, collapse detectors
│   ├── utils/              # Seeding, multi-stream logging, config parsing
│   ├── theory/             # Toy model simulation, gradient flow, Jacobian
│   ├── data/               # CIFAR-10-C streaming loader & synthetic data generator
│   ├── models/             # RobustBench model wrappers & BN parameter filtering
│   └── tta/                # Adaptation methods: Source, TENT, TENT-IM, RDumb
├── scripts/                # Entry-point execution scripts
├── results/                # Run logs, CSVs, and generated figures
└── tests/                  # Unit test suite
```

