## Roadmap & Execution Phases
- [x] **Phase 0**: Repository scaffold, config system, seeding, structured logging, and unit-tested information metrics.
- [ ] **Phase 1**: Toy model simulation, gradient descent flow, collapse reproduction, and basin boundary mapping.
- [ ] **Phase 2**: Analytical derivation of $\dot{b}$, Jacobian computation, eigenvalue verification, and $\eta^*$ evaluation.
- [ ] **Phase 3**: Continual CIFAR-10-C streaming pipeline, Source & TENT baselines, and empirical collapse logging.
- [ ] **Phase 4**: Stable Information-Maximisation (TENT-IM) and RDumb implementation under identical streams.
- [ ] **Phase 5**: Multi-seed analysis, phase diagrams, ablation studies, and publication-ready figures.
- [ ] **Phase 6**: Interactive Streamlit demonstration.
- [ ] **Phase 7**: Comprehensive technical documentation and interview guide (`INTERVIEW_QA.md`).
